# Static-asset caching for the OpenNext/Workers build.
#
# Next's hashed build output under /_next/static/ never changes for a given
# build, so it is safe to cache immutably at the edge. Everything else falls
# back to Next's own `Cache-Control` handling and the rules in `next.config.ts`.
/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public,max-age=31536000,immutable
